{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03201",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.52,
      "end_seconds": 3.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. Lovely to meet you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.27,
      "end_seconds": 8.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. Tell me why you came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.31,
      "end_seconds": 20.84,
      "duration_seconds": 9.53,
      "text": "mainly a pearly bump on my nose that bleeds. There's a couple of other things, but that's the main one"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.25,
      "end_seconds": 25.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.57,
      "end_seconds": 28.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "It's been one week now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.75,
      "end_seconds": 37.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.22,
      "end_seconds": 53.63,
      "duration_seconds": 15.41,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get a sore that won't heal as well. The sore that won't heal? That's been since last night. As for sore that won't heal, it's moderate, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.51,
      "end_seconds": 61.63,
      "duration_seconds": 7.12,
      "text": "Have you had a pearly bump on your nose that bleeds before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.83,
      "end_seconds": 67.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "a bit, last year. It settled by itself back then"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.61,
      "end_seconds": 71.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "And other new lumps, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.33,
      "end_seconds": 75.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Definitely no other new lumps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.08,
      "end_seconds": 83.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "Any pain, family history of skin cancer or swollen glands?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.27,
      "end_seconds": 91.03,
      "duration_seconds": 6.76,
      "text": "I haven't had pain, family history of skin cancer or swollen glands, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.24,
      "end_seconds": 96.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "any trouble with the waterworks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.55,
      "end_seconds": 99.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "nothing there, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.25,
      "end_seconds": 103.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.04,
      "end_seconds": 106.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "nothing else aches"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.73,
      "end_seconds": 124.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.58,
      "end_seconds": 129.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Mirtazapine. I take it it 15 milligrams, at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.91,
      "end_seconds": 148.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.37,
      "end_seconds": 163.35,
      "duration_seconds": 9.98,
      "text": "I have about eight cigarettes in a day. My partner and our baby. I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.26,
      "end_seconds": 168.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.45,
      "end_seconds": 176.65,
      "duration_seconds": 6.2,
      "text": "I've had depression, yes. I just want to get back to normal, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.18,
      "end_seconds": 186.89,
      "duration_seconds": 8.71,
      "text": "Right, so depression is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.0,
      "end_seconds": 195.63,
      "duration_seconds": 7.63,
      "text": "I had a reaction to diclofenac when I was younger, wheezing, and I've avoided it since"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.4,
      "end_seconds": 199.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.47,
      "end_seconds": 203.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "oh, no, not at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.89,
      "end_seconds": 215.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.9,
      "end_seconds": 229.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.78,
      "end_seconds": 243.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 116 over 69, heart rate 75."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.86,
      "end_seconds": 247.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.3,
      "end_seconds": 250.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "Nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.46,
      "end_seconds": 268.65,
      "duration_seconds": 9.19,
      "text": "There is a pearly nodule with fine surface vessels and a central dip on the side of the nose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 273.27,
      "end_seconds": 274.26,
      "duration_seconds": 0.99,
      "text": "Sure thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.89,
      "end_seconds": 292.4,
      "duration_seconds": 14.51,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check. Right, here's what I'm thinking. This looks most like a likely basal cell carcinoma. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 293.98,
      "end_seconds": 298.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "Actually, I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.73,
      "end_seconds": 322.66,
      "duration_seconds": 22.93,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a likely basal cell carcinoma, but I'd like to confirm. Let me repeat that back to make sure. You've had a pearly bump on your nose that bleeds for one week, and no family history of skin cancer or other new lumps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 324.32,
      "end_seconds": 325.02,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "exactly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.04,
      "end_seconds": 329.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "We should do a dermoscopy for suspicious lesion."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.35,
      "end_seconds": 333.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "do I need to prepare?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.58,
      "end_seconds": 355.98,
      "duration_seconds": 21.4,
      "text": "I'll request a skin biopsy, it'll help with suspicious lesion. Please use a high-factor sunscreen and a hat. The skin cancer clinic would be the right next step, I'll refer you. If the symptoms get worse, that's the point to come in urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 356.49,
      "end_seconds": 360.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Yes, I'll bear that that in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 361.43,
      "end_seconds": 371.98,
      "duration_seconds": 10.55,
      "text": "I'll want another look after the biopsy. Can you tell me the plan back in your own words, so I know I've explained it clearly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 373.91,
      "end_seconds": 378.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "so, I come back after the biopsy is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 379.66,
      "end_seconds": 384.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 385.04,
      "end_seconds": 386.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "that's clear, thanks"
    }
  ]
}